## VibeVoice

The optional `-Engine 7b` fallback expects VibeVoice-7B Q8 weights installed outside this repository. The Microsoft VibeVoice software repository is MIT:

https://github.com/microsoft/VibeVoice/blob/main/LICENSE

That MIT grant was not verified for the TTS weights this pipeline was run with. The official project page states that the TTS release was disabled after misuse (https://microsoft.github.io/VibeVoice/). The published ASR-7B model is a different model. Do not describe the fallback weights as MIT until their origin, revision, and license are checked on the machine that holds them.

`podcast.ps1` can still drive VibeVoice-1.5B. Those weights are also not in this repository. `voices.json` marks the VibeVoice demo voices as "license not verified".

